  "legal.refund-policy": "Refund Policy",
  "legal.accessibility-statement": "Accessibility Statement",
  "legal.fallback.terms": "<p>These terms govern your use of Kinevor GYM facilities, app and website. By joining you agree to follow gym rules, class booking policies and staff instructions. Memberships are personal, non-transferable and subject to the chosen plan duration and price.</p><p>We may update these terms; material changes will be notified by email or in-app message.</p>",
  "legal.fallback.privacy": "<p>We collect only the data needed to run your membership: identity, contact, billing and health information you provide. Health data is processed solely for safe training and with your explicit consent.</p><p>You may export or erase your data from your profile. Some billing records are retained where the law requires it.</p>",
  "legal.fallback.cancellation-policy": "<p>Monthly plans can be cancelled before the next renewal date; access continues until the end of the paid period. Fixed-term plans follow the cancellation terms shown at purchase.</p><p>Cancellations are free of charge and take effect immediately in your account.</p>",
  "legal.fallback.refund-policy": "<p>Unused portions of cancelled monthly plans are not refundable. Duplicate or failed payments are refunded in full within 10 business days to the original payment method.</p><p>Trial sessions are free and require no refund.</p>",
  "legal.fallback.accessibility-statement": "<p>We are committed to an accessible experience for every member. Our app targets WCAG 2.1 AA, supports keyboard navigation, screen readers, reduced motion and Arabic right-to-left layout.</p><p>If you face a barrier, contact support and we will provide an alternative as soon as possible.</p>",
